  "summary": "Billed by the hour with no commitment, in credits at a hundred to the dollar. Every card is priced \"From\": Hostinger says availability changes in real time and varies by region, and it names no region for any product. The footer states prices are listed without VAT, and the page promises no hidden fees or egress charges.",
